      "writtenOn": "2022-11-23T19:39:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My understanding is that this is the safest use of a wait queue lock. Previously I was using wait_event_interruptible() in this place and it was causing 50% longer boot time and inverted high priority ... presumably due to the loop being woken too often. I can experiment with this more if an alternative is needed, though I\u0027m guessing this will have to be reworked anyhow once Sudhin\u0027s priorities are being used.",
